{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47304","headline":"步虚词十首 三 · 吴筠","name":"步虚词十首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三宫发明景，朗照同郁仪。\n纷然驰飙歘，上釆空清蕤。\n令我洞金色，後天耀琼姿。\n心协太虚静，寥寥竟何思。\n玄中有至乐，淡泊终无爲。\n但与正真友，飘颻散遨嬉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}